## Summary

Wire steward_gate(FINALIZATION) into the merge engine's finalization seams (run_merge_with_fallback, resolve_verified_threads, pr_merge): require fresh Steward=READY plus independent embedded_audit=PASS, switch the merge to GraphQL mergePullRequest with expectedHeadOid (triple-SHA match), keep governed_automerge default OFF, add per-PR train readiness and audit refresh with no audit reuse, bound passes, and forbid empty commits.

## Scope

Allowlist-bound; see commit.allowlist. Out of scope: Do not enable governed_automerge by default. Do not admin-bypass squash without supervisor. Do not mutate branch protection. If expectedHeadOid is unsupported by the gh auth scope, record UNKNOWN; do not fall back to ungated gh pr merge.

## Validation

See commit.verify; embedded audit + proof bundle required.

> RED-LANE: RED-LANE plus SUPERVISOR: grants the merge engine governed merge authority. Embedded audit and explicit supervisor sign-off required before execution.

